WEBVTT

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:20.640
Miyuki, you know it's not Sunday today, right-kuru?

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:23.040
Don't you need to go to school-kuru?

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:25.740
Nope! Today's the first day of summer vacation!

00:00:26.810 --> 00:00:27.680
"Summer vacation"?

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:31.950
It means you get to take the day off... every day!

00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:35.290
The day off... every day-kuru?!

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:38.820
Yay! Every day's a day off! Every day's a day off!

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:40.930
{C:Kuru!}

00:00:45.630 --> 00:00:48.530
It's not like I have anything really to do, though...

00:00:48.530 --> 00:00:49.600
So much for that...

00:00:51.140 --> 00:00:52.810
I'll get it!

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:54.890
Hello?

00:00:54.890 --> 00:00:57.580
Hey, Akane-chan! What's up?

00:00:57.580 --> 00:01:00.080
Yeah... okay...

00:01:01.510 --> 00:01:03.710
Sure! I'll come! <i>Of course</i> I'll come!

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:05.300
I'll be right there!

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:07.690
She's at the beach...

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:08.420
The beach?

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:09.990
The beach, the beach, the beach!

00:01:14.860 --> 00:01:19.800
<i>The beach!</i>

00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:35.010
Yahoo!

00:01:37.960 --> 00:01:39.530
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:01:39.530 --> 00:01:41.360
Smile Precure!

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:42.260
Let's go!

00:01:42.260 --> 00:01:43.800
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:43.800 --> 00:01:44.930
All together!

00:01:45.170 --> 00:01:46.530
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:46.530 --> 00:01:48.740
Jump to tomorrow!

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:51.410
Smile Precure!

00:01:53.270 --> 00:01:56.240
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:01:56.510 --> 00:02:01.680
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:02:02.050 --> 00:02:06.890
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:02:07.620 --> 00:02:12.830
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:02:13.190 --> 00:02:17.770
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:17.730
So bright!

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:22.940
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:29.380
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:02:27.340 --> 00:02:29.880
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:02:30.410 --> 00:02:31.050
Let's go!

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:33.750
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:36.680
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:02:37.020 --> 00:02:41.490
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:42.060
Girls! Let's go!

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:43.720
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:44.860
Everybody!

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:46.530
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:46.530 --> 00:02:49.060
Fly to the future!

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:52.570
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:02:53.330 --> 00:02:54.740
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:57.040
Smile Precure!

00:03:03.730 --> 00:03:05.570
I'm bored-oni...

00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:11.140
Yes, it's summer again! Time to head to the sea and work on your tan!

00:03:11.140 --> 00:03:15.110
Why not head down to the beach and make it a summer to remember?

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:17.110
That sounds great-oni!

00:03:17.710 --> 00:03:23.150
I'm gonna get nicely tanned, and make it a summer to remember-oni!

00:03:29.190 --> 00:03:31.290
I can't wait to play in the sea!

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:32.360
Yeah!

00:03:32.380 --> 00:03:35.430
Let's see, I said I'd meet Akane-chan...

00:03:35.430 --> 00:03:36.860
Ah, that's gotta be it!

00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:42.570
Akane-chan? I'm here!

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:44.510
Come on in!

00:03:44.510 --> 00:03:46.370
Oh, it's you, Miyuki!

00:03:46.670 --> 00:03:47.970
Akane-chan!

00:03:47.980 --> 00:03:49.840
There ya are! I've been waitin' for ya!

00:03:51.940 --> 00:03:54.320
Welcome!

00:03:54.320 --> 00:03:57.280
A strawberry snowcone, then. One moment, please.

00:04:02.160 --> 00:04:02.880
Here.

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:03.650
Thank you.

00:04:04.190 --> 00:04:05.590
Here is your snowcone.

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:07.660
Nao-chan?! Reika-chan?!

00:04:08.440 --> 00:04:10.600
They're reelin' in the sales too, huh?

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:12.670
But they ain't beatin' me that easy!

00:04:12.680 --> 00:04:15.670
Come get some damn good okonomiyaki!

00:04:18.010 --> 00:04:19.690
That's how you wanna play it, huh?

00:04:21.340 --> 00:04:25.710
Why not try a cool, refreshing snowcone?

00:04:28.340 --> 00:04:31.080
Pipin' hot okonomiyaki's just the thing for summer!

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:33.370
Sweet, crisp snowcones!

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:35.480
Fire yourself up with okonomiyaki!

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:38.090
So cool, so delicious! You've gotta have a snowcone!

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:41.000
Just the smell of the sauce will have ya droolin'!

00:04:41.490 --> 00:04:43.760
U-Umm...

00:04:52.110 --> 00:04:53.740
Thanks for coming!

00:04:53.990 --> 00:04:55.370
Come again!

00:04:57.340 --> 00:05:00.550
So, uh, Akane-chan... why am I—?

00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:02.080
I know, I know!

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:06.420
Ya wanna play at the sea, right? Gotta tell ya, I do too!

00:05:06.420 --> 00:05:09.490
But ya know, I was really in a bind.

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:13.190
Not that I'm unhappy about opening a shop here for the summer,

00:05:13.190 --> 00:05:16.830
but then Dad suddenly got stuck at home with a bad back,

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:19.500
and Genki's at training camp for basketball,

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:21.370
so it's all down to Mom and me!

00:05:21.370 --> 00:05:25.270
You're my final hope here, Miyuki!

00:05:28.240 --> 00:05:31.280
Sorry about this, dear. I know you're on vacation too.

00:05:31.280 --> 00:05:34.200
No, no, I'm glad to help!

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:35.920
But I wanna play-kuru!

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:39.490
Thank you very much for your patronage.

00:05:39.490 --> 00:05:43.320
Err... no... it's, um, my pleasure...

00:05:43.340 --> 00:05:45.830
So, what are Nao-chan and Reika-chan doing here, then?

00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:51.460
Well, apparently Nao's gramps runs the stall next door, and she's here helpin' out.

00:05:52.170 --> 00:05:53.630
What a shame, though!

00:05:53.880 --> 00:05:57.350
If only Yayoi-chan was here too, we'd have the whole team together.

00:06:00.870 --> 00:06:05.300
Do I get a nice refreshing snowcone, or...

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:08.250
...do I get some piping hot okonomiyaki.

00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:09.780
Decisions, decisions...

00:06:09.790 --> 00:06:10.690
Snowcone, duh!

00:06:10.690 --> 00:06:12.120
Okonomiyaki!

00:06:13.990 --> 00:06:15.190
Yayoi-chan!

00:06:15.190 --> 00:06:16.960
What are... you guys doing here?

00:06:17.120 --> 00:06:19.990
Yay! Now everybody's here!

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:22.120
Did you come to play at the beach?

00:06:22.120 --> 00:06:25.290
No, I'm doing my art homework. I thought I'd paint a picture of the ocean.

00:06:25.300 --> 00:06:27.300
Yayoi! Let's play-kuru!

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:31.040
Excuse me! Could I get a melon snowcone?

00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:34.850
Ah, right! One melon snowcone, coming right up!

00:06:35.380 --> 00:06:37.980
Oh, the lunchtime rush is starting!

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:39.900
Miyuki, drum us up some business!

00:06:39.900 --> 00:06:42.220
Come get yerself some mouth-waterin' okonomiyaki!

00:06:42.220 --> 00:06:45.290
Get ya stamina back with some okonomiyaki!

00:06:45.290 --> 00:06:46.320
Come on, Miyuki!

00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:47.960
U-Umm...

00:06:47.960 --> 00:06:50.290
C-Come get yerself some watery okonomiyaki!

00:06:50.290 --> 00:06:51.330
...Close enough...

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:52.460
Okonomiyaki, huh?

00:06:52.460 --> 00:06:55.160
Sounds good. Two okonomiyakis, please!

00:06:55.160 --> 00:06:57.830
Two okonomiyakis, comin' up!

00:06:57.830 --> 00:06:58.770
Thank you!

00:06:59.570 --> 00:07:02.570
Get your snowcones while they're ice cold!

00:07:02.570 --> 00:07:04.570
I want a snowcone!

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:06.770
I think I'll have some okonomiyaki.

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:08.370
Two with shrimp, please!

00:07:08.380 --> 00:07:09.880
I'll have an okonomiyaki with pork!

00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:12.110
Three slurries to go!

00:07:12.110 --> 00:07:13.410
Strawberry cone for me, please!

00:07:14.420 --> 00:07:17.280
Form a second queue, please!

00:07:17.280 --> 00:07:20.180
Please tell me your orders!

00:07:20.180 --> 00:07:22.260
I wanna go play by the sea!

00:07:22.260 --> 00:07:24.530
Okay then, let's go down to the water!

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:28.310
What's gotten into those two today?

00:07:28.310 --> 00:07:31.810
Akane-san is a volleyball player, and Nao plays soccer...

00:07:31.810 --> 00:07:34.440
They're both sportswomen at heart.

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:39.570
I fear the presence of a rival — a competitor they can beat — is stirring them on...

00:07:40.040 --> 00:07:42.610
We can have this place all to ourselves!

00:07:43.390 --> 00:07:46.570
Let's Go: Dress!

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:50.470
That's so cute!

00:07:50.470 --> 00:07:53.350
Okay then, let's play-kuru!

00:07:53.350 --> 00:07:54.820
Come again!

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:56.230
Have a nice day!

00:07:56.230 --> 00:07:57.900
Please come again!

00:07:57.900 --> 00:07:59.900
Man, business is thrivin'!

00:07:59.900 --> 00:08:03.160
Looks like <i>my</i> shop got the biggest haul of the day...

00:08:03.160 --> 00:08:06.700
I have a feeling <i>our</i> queue was a lot longer than yours...

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:12.130
Nice work, kid. You go take a rest for a bit, okay?

00:08:12.130 --> 00:08:15.080
We'll be fine too, so you go have some fun.

00:08:15.080 --> 00:08:18.310
Alright! Now we can finally play together!

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:20.510
Look, I brought a beachball to play with!

00:08:21.650 --> 00:08:22.950
A <i>ball?!</i>

00:08:33.770 --> 00:08:34.960
It's on!

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:36.930
Is this... necessary?

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:39.000
Get it, Miyuki!

00:08:40.510 --> 00:08:41.300
Nice one!

00:08:41.300 --> 00:08:43.960
Hino Special Attack!

00:08:46.240 --> 00:08:48.440
Get to that court! It's soccer time!

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:50.150
Bring it on!

00:08:50.410 --> 00:08:52.350
Kuru!

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:54.130
Wait for me!

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:55.980
Kuru~

00:09:02.270 --> 00:09:03.320
A'ight, next game!

00:09:03.320 --> 00:09:05.000
Are you serious?

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:06.360
Hey, girls!

00:09:06.360 --> 00:09:09.760
I've sliced you some watermelon, so have a bite to eat.

00:09:09.760 --> 00:09:12.210
Oh, thank you very much!

00:09:12.210 --> 00:09:14.980
Come on you two, enough of that!

00:09:14.980 --> 00:09:16.640
I made some lunch!

00:09:18.590 --> 00:09:20.210
It's so yummy-kuru!

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:24.040
Thanks for the food!

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:26.190
I didn't waste a drop!

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:29.110
Ya think? Look at this perfection!

00:09:29.120 --> 00:09:31.250
That's laser precision, that is!

00:09:34.230 --> 00:09:35.460
Kuru!

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:39.110
We got this pretty high, huh?

00:09:39.110 --> 00:09:40.520
Yeah, I'll give you that.

00:09:40.520 --> 00:09:43.560
But you really need to work on your style.

00:09:45.800 --> 00:09:48.670
Everyone's here, and we're doing <i>this...</i>

00:09:52.940 --> 00:09:54.610
Yahoo!

00:09:55.080 --> 00:09:57.340
It's summer-oni! I'm at the sea-oni!

00:09:57.340 --> 00:10:03.020
Time to get myself a tan and make it a summer to remember-oni!

00:10:07.430 --> 00:10:08.770
Happy!

00:10:14.370 --> 00:10:15.650
Candy!

00:10:19.330 --> 00:10:20.700
I can do that!

00:10:20.700 --> 00:10:23.840
Snip snip, shuffle shuffle!

00:10:34.790 --> 00:10:37.190
Whatcha think? I caught way more than you!

00:10:37.190 --> 00:10:38.970
I don't think so, somehow.

00:10:38.970 --> 00:10:40.800
Why not just call it a draw...?

00:10:40.800 --> 00:10:42.920
Ya can't just end on a draw!

00:10:43.110 --> 00:10:45.010
Fine, we'll have a swimming race next!

00:10:45.010 --> 00:10:46.690
Bring it on!

00:10:46.690 --> 00:10:49.770
Alright, the goal's ta be the first one to reach that...

00:10:50.130 --> 00:10:51.200
...that...?

00:10:58.940 --> 00:11:01.440
Yahoo-oni!

00:11:01.440 --> 00:11:03.080
Akaoni?!

00:11:10.620 --> 00:11:15.020
Summer's a very special season, so I'm gonna make my entrance by sea-oni!

00:11:15.260 --> 00:11:18.590
Time to start making it a summer to remember-oni!

00:11:18.590 --> 00:11:19.230
Oni?

00:11:19.230 --> 00:11:21.630
Look at all those humans-oni!

00:11:21.630 --> 00:11:25.570
I'll make it a summer they'll want to forget-oni!

00:11:25.570 --> 00:11:28.500
This world will be stained with the worst possible conclusion...

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:31.340
...a Bad End-oni!

00:11:31.340 --> 00:11:34.580
The blank slate of your future will be clouded in darkness-oni!

00:11:41.550 --> 00:11:49.120
The Bad Energy we gather from the humans will resurrect the Emperor of Darkness, Pierrot-sama, oni!

00:11:53.150 --> 00:11:54.700
Get away from them!

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:57.770
The Precure-oni?!

00:11:57.770 --> 00:12:00.700
I'm not letting you get between me and my tan-oni!

00:12:00.700 --> 00:12:03.580
Come on out, Super Akanbe!

00:12:06.750 --> 00:12:09.610
Super Akanbe!

00:12:09.610 --> 00:12:10.840
Kuru!

00:12:11.110 --> 00:12:14.720
These humans are gonna have one crappy holiday! Consider it a gift from me-oni!

00:12:14.720 --> 00:12:18.910
I don't think so! We won't let you ruin their holidays!

00:12:18.910 --> 00:12:19.450
Yeah!

00:12:23.130 --> 00:12:24.430
Ready?

00:12:24.990 --> 00:12:27.700
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:12:27.700 --> 00:12:28.780
Go!

00:12:29.700 --> 00:12:31.090
Go, go!

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:33.080
Let's go!

00:13:01.260 --> 00:13:04.310
The light of the future, shining bright!

00:13:05.410 --> 00:13:07.310
Cure Happy!

00:13:10.040 --> 00:13:12.030
Dazzling sun!

00:13:12.030 --> 00:13:14.060
Hot-blooded power!

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:16.590
Cure Sunny!

00:13:19.210 --> 00:13:22.270
Rock, paper, scissors! Sparkling bright...

00:13:23.610 --> 00:13:25.370
Cure Peace!

00:13:27.460 --> 00:13:31.080
Laying down the gauntlet, with courage blazing!

00:13:32.170 --> 00:13:34.170
Cure March!

00:13:36.410 --> 00:13:40.030
A gentle heart as pure as the driven snow...

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:43.060
Cure Beauty!

00:13:45.100 --> 00:13:47.830
Our five lights will blaze a path to the future!

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:57.820
Shining bright, Smile Precure!

00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:04.560
Super Akanbe!

00:14:04.960 --> 00:14:07.030
Come on, everybody!

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:11.990
Leave this to me!

00:14:11.990 --> 00:14:13.550
I can take him!

00:14:13.550 --> 00:14:14.800
You're still gonna do this?!

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:18.850
With my speed...

00:14:19.440 --> 00:14:20.410
Super?

00:14:22.730 --> 00:14:25.550
Akanbe! Akanbe!

00:14:29.990 --> 00:14:32.220
Super Akanbe...

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:33.530
Akan?!

00:14:35.960 --> 00:14:38.800
With my kinda power...

00:14:44.570 --> 00:14:46.740
Super Akanbe!

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:48.530
That was a close one...

00:14:48.530 --> 00:14:49.490
One more time...

00:14:49.490 --> 00:14:50.950
I'll getcha for that!

00:14:53.570 --> 00:14:54.980
Hey!

00:14:56.310 --> 00:14:58.150
Wait up, you two!

00:14:59.090 --> 00:14:59.950
Oni?

00:15:00.480 --> 00:15:02.920
They're leaving their friends behind-oni!

00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:05.790
That's great! Do that more-oni!

00:15:06.690 --> 00:15:08.890
The Precure are over there, you dolt-oni!

00:15:09.100 --> 00:15:12.320
Super Akanbe!

00:15:16.030 --> 00:15:20.000
Super Akanbe!

00:15:33.680 --> 00:15:35.380
Super...

00:15:35.380 --> 00:15:38.800
Akanbe!

00:15:45.160 --> 00:15:46.560
You guys!

00:15:46.560 --> 00:15:48.790
Are you two okay?

00:15:53.030 --> 00:15:54.940
We're trapped in here!

00:15:54.950 --> 00:15:56.300
It's so cold...

00:15:57.500 --> 00:16:00.210
If they don't get out, they'll freeze-kuru!

00:16:00.210 --> 00:16:02.310
Happy... Peace...!

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:03.570
Beauty...!

00:16:04.430 --> 00:16:07.510
Don't worry, I'll save ya!

00:16:08.080 --> 00:16:10.720
I'm going to rescue you!

00:16:11.210 --> 00:16:14.290
Super Akakakaka!

00:16:15.690 --> 00:16:17.930
That's it! Now finish off those last two-oni!

00:16:18.860 --> 00:16:22.760
Hey, stop spinning-oni! Do as you're told-oni!

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:26.670
I'm never gonna get a tan like this-oni!

00:16:30.540 --> 00:16:34.310
This blizzard ain't no match for my fire!

00:16:34.310 --> 00:16:36.280
Or my wind!

00:16:53.060 --> 00:16:56.200
Happy, Peace, Beauty...

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:04.770
I don't have what it takes...

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:08.240
I can't save them...

00:17:25.700 --> 00:17:26.960
March...

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:37.970
Sunny...

00:18:10.470 --> 00:18:13.740
My fire...

00:18:13.740 --> 00:18:15.590
...and my wind...

00:18:16.220 --> 00:18:18.900
Our powers are becoming one...?

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:30.270
Let's take 'em, March!

00:18:30.270 --> 00:18:31.340
Okay!

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:34.310
Super Akan...?

00:18:34.310 --> 00:18:37.890
Super Akanbe!

00:18:49.170 --> 00:18:50.630
Precure...

00:18:50.630 --> 00:18:52.720
Sunny Fire!

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:54.770
Precure...

00:18:54.770 --> 00:18:57.910
March Shoot!

00:18:58.220 --> 00:19:02.260
Akan...!

00:19:07.880 --> 00:19:09.740
Sunny! March!

00:19:09.740 --> 00:19:11.200
...be...

00:19:12.100 --> 00:19:13.770
Super!

00:19:13.950 --> 00:19:14.660
Come on!

00:19:14.660 --> 00:19:15.240
Okay!

00:19:18.620 --> 00:19:22.300
Pegasus, grant us your power!

00:19:36.710 --> 00:19:38.960
Princess Happy!

00:19:38.960 --> 00:19:41.160
Princess Sunny!

